# BuildKit reads this file instead of a root .dockerignore for apps/recruitment/Dockerfile.
# The context is the repo root: send only shared/ and apps/recruitment/, so the developer's
# .env, .git, venvs, PDFs and the gha-creds-*.json written by google-github-actions/auth stay out.
*
!shared/
!apps/recruitment/

**/.env*
**/gha-creds-*.json
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache
**/*.pdf
apps/recruitment/Dockerfile*
apps/recruitment/tests
apps/recruitment/infra
apps/recruitment/apps_script
